{"id": "t062-004", "text": "Call w/ Emily - her son Jack sits his GCSEs May 2027, she's already stressing about revision timetables. Check in with her a week after the mocks.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "GCSEs", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressing about revision timetables", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mocks", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t062-012", "text": "Tadhg's leaving do was meant to be Thurs but it's been called off, his start date got pushed so he's staying on till Christmas. Still going to the pub Thursday anyway.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tadhg", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thurs"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "start date", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying on", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "till Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to the pub", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t062-014", "text": "demi said her little girl lost her first tooth today and got £2 from the tooth fairy. inflation lol", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "demi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little girl", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first tooth", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t062-016", "text": "Lunch with Lwazi. He's interviewing for the deputy head job on 4 Nov 2026 and he's really anxious about the presentation part. Text him good luck the night before, then ask how it went afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lwazi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interviewing for the deputy head job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "4 Nov 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious about the presentation part", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t062-017", "text": "Yusuf's son Malik got into Manchester for medicine, offer came through yesterday. Yusuf can't stop smiling", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into Manchester for medicine", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't stop smiling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t062-018", "text": "Chiara's sister is graduating in Bologna in July 2027, whole family's going. Chiara wants to take a week off after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduating in Bologna", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in July 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t062-022", "text": "Bruno's dog Pepper is coming to the office from now on. He's a beagle. Bruno loves him more than people.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from now on"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "beagle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "loves him more than people", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t062-023", "text": "Magda says her eldest's doing her A level art exhibition March 2027. She paints, mostly portraits. Want to go.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Magda", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "A level art exhibition", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "paints", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "portraits", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "go", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "on"}]}
{"id": "t062-028", "text": "Wiremu said his mum's coming over from Auckland in February 2027 for a month. First time she's left NZ. He's taking her to Edinburgh the week after she lands, then down to see his sister Mila in Cornwall. She's vegetarian and doesn't like flying much so he's worried about the 24 hours on the plane. He wants recommendations for somewhere nice to eat in Edinburgh, I said I'd send him a list.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wiremu", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming over from Auckland", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in February 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking her to Edinburgh", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after she lands", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mila", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't like flying much", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about the 24 hours on the plane", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t062-029", "text": "Rachel - promoted to partner. Announced today, first woman in the Leeds office to make it. Her wife's throwing a party Saturday, I'm invited. Bring wine, she drinks white. Their son Arjun's back from uni for it too, he's doing law at Durham now and apparently wants to work with Rachel one day. She pretended to hate the idea but was clearly delighted.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rachel", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promoted to partner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "first woman in the Leeds office to make it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Bring wine", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "drinks white", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing law at Durham", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to work with", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rachel", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "one day"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "delighted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t062-031", "text": "Ahmed's wife Pooja is expecting again, due August 2027. He mentioned it really casually like it wasn't news", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "August 2027", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t062-032", "text": "voice note: right so Sophie rang, her brother Tadhg's graduation is tomorrow and she's driving down to Exeter that morning, and then she's back the day after and she wants to do dinner on the Sunday, so I need to keep Sunday free and ask her how the ceremony went", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tadhg", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduation", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving down to Exeter", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Sunday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "keep Sunday free", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her how the ceremony went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t062-033", "text": "Yuki starts her new role at Sony on 2 November 2026. She's a bit terrified tbh, it's her first management job and she's inheriting a team of eight, two of whom applied for the same role. Her partner's away that whole week with work too, so she'll be on her own with the kids. Text her the evening before to say good luck, and maybe drop off some food that weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yuki", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new role at Sony", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit terrified", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "first management job", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "inheriting a team of eight", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "away", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that whole week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the evening before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off some food", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that weekend", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t062-036", "text": "Mila's not doing the half marathon anymore, knee's gone again. Physio twice a week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mila", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "knee's gone again", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Physio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "twice a week", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t062-038", "text": "Jen - her boss is leaving end of Nov and she's been asked to act up. She's not sure she wants it. Talk to her about it at the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of Nov", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "act up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sure she wants it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Talk to her about it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t062-041", "text": "Tadhg's retiring dad (Uncle Bruno to everyone) has his do on 6 Dec 2026, Tadhg's giving a speech and is dreading it. Remind me to message him the morning of.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tadhg", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Bruno", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "do", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6 Dec 2026", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tadhg", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the morning of", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t062-042", "text": "Antoine's daughter is starting uni in Lyon in September 2027. He's already planning to drive her down and stay a few days afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Antoine", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni in Lyon", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "drive her down", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few days afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t062-043", "text": "Demi's partner Jack has been offered a job in Dubai, they've got till Friday to decide. She's torn. Her kids are 6 and 9 so it's a big deal, the eldest has just got into the school choir and is finally settled. Her mum lives round the corner and does all the school pick ups, so that'd go too. Demi kept saying it's an amazing opportunity for him but she didn't sound convinced.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Demi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job in Dubai", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "till Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "decide", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "torn", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "6 and 9", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the school choir", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "settled", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives round the corner", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "does all the school pick ups", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Demi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f7", "type": "FACT", "text": "didn't sound convinced", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t062-046", "text": "Chiara's leaving the firm, last day 18 Dec. Going freelance, mostly brand work, and she's already got two clients lined up for January. Her husband's a bit worried about money but she's buzzing. She said no fuss for her last day, but the team are doing lunch that afternoon anyway and I'm organising the card. Chiara drinks Aperol, loves anything with lemons on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chiara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving the firm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "18 Dec", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Going freelance", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "mostly brand work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "January", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit worried about money", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "buzzing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chiara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "drinks Aperol", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "anything with lemons on", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t062-047", "text": "Keisha's cat Biscuit has to have a tooth out Tues. Keisha's anxious, cat's 14. Text her after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tooth out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tues", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t062-052", "text": "Bruno and Magda's anniversary is 5 March, 10 years in 2027. Magda's dropping hints about a weekend in Lisbon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Magda", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5 March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "10 years", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Magda", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dropping hints about a weekend in Lisbon", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t062-056", "text": "So Julien rang about the hen do, it's off, Rachel and Luis split up last month. Julien's gutted for her. Should send Rachel a message, nothing heavy.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rachel", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Rachel a message", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rachel", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t062-057", "text": "Wiremu has a 6-month review Friday, he thinks it's going to be fine but his manager's new. Ask him how it went Monday", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wiremu", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "6-month review", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinks it's going to be fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t062-059", "text": "Ahmed's brother Yusuf (Yus) is staying with him for a month while he job hunts. Ahmed's happy about it, his kids less so.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yus", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with him", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "while he job hunts", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "happy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}]}
